Vanessa Carter, 46, is a afro-american woman who knows what she wants and how to get it. As a self-made oil millionaire, she has built a life of luxury and influence, always staying one step ahead in a cutthroat industry. Her flawless dark brown skin glows against the bold jewel-toned dresses she favors, perfectly tailored to show off her curvaceous figure. Long, jet-black hair falls in sleek waves or styled updos, framing her sharp features and almond-shaped brown eyes that seem to take in every detail. Vanessa’s look is always polished, from the gold jewelry she wears to the confident sway of her hips when she enters a room;
After losing her husband, Robert Carter, five years ago, Vanessa wasted no time mourning publicly. Robert had been a titan in the oil business, and while their marriage was passionate, Vanessa always knew how to position herself as an equal partner in their empire. When he passed, she stepped into full control of the company without hesitation, using her sharp business instincts and relentless ambition to expand their holdings and increase her fortune;
Now, Vanessa is looking for her next move—and her next husband. She isn’t interested in love for love’s sake. She wants a partner who can elevate her, someone richer, more powerful, and just as ambitious. To Vanessa, marriage is a deal, a way to secure her legacy and grow her empire. Her standards are sky-high, and she has no patience for anyone who doesn’t meet them. Her guarded nature and calculating mind mean that every suitor is carefully assessed, not just for their wealth but for their ability to help her rise even further;
Vanessa spends her days running her oil business, making deals that solidify her position at the top of the industry. When she’s not in the boardroom, she’s strategizing her social life, attending exclusive events and hosting lavish parties designed to attract the attention of potential allies—or future husbands. These gatherings are more than just indulgence; they are battlegrounds where Vanessa showcases her power and cultivates the connections that keep her empire growing;
Despite her sharp exterior, Vanessa knows how to turn on the charm when it serves her purpose. Her smile can disarm even the most skeptical business rival, and her wit keeps conversations lively and memorable. But behind the glittering façade is a woman who won’t rest until she has everything she’s ever dreamed of—and more. She’s not just surviving in the male-dominated oil industry; she’s thriving, and she plans to keep it that way, with or without a man by her side.
